#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Build/Releasing/First-Time-Release.rst:6
msgid "First Time Release"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Build/Releasing/First-Time-Release.rst:8
msgid ""
"This guide explains how to release ROS 2 packages that you have not released "
"before. Due to numerous options available when releasing ROS packages, this "
"guide intends to cover the most common scenario and does not cover every "
"corner-case."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Build/Releasing/First-Time-Release.rst:13
msgid "Table of Contents"
msgstr "目录"

