#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Build/Releasing/First-Time-Release.rst:36
msgid "Set Up a Personal Access Token"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Build/Releasing/_Personal-Access-Token.rst:7
msgid ""
"If the file ``~/.config/bloom`` exists on your computer, it is likely that "
"you have done this before so you should skip this section."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Build/Releasing/_Personal-Access-Token.rst:9
msgid ""
"During the release process, multiple HTTPS Git operations will be performed "
"that require password authentication. To avoid being repeatedly asked for a "
"password, a `Personal Access Token (PAT) <https://docs.github.com/en/"
"authentication/keeping-your-account-and-data-secure/creating-a-personal-"
"access-token>`_ will be set up. If you have multi-factor authentication "
"setup on your GitHub account, you **must** setup a Personal Access Token."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Build/Releasing/_Personal-Access-Token.rst:13
msgid "Create a Personal Access Token by:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Build/Releasing/_Personal-Access-Token.rst:15
msgid ""
"Log in to GitHub and go to `Personal access tokens <https://github.com/"
"settings/tokens>`_."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Build/Releasing/_Personal-Access-Token.rst:16
msgid "Click the **Generate new token** button."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Build/Releasing/_Personal-Access-Token.rst:17
msgid "In the dropdown, select **Generate new token (classic)**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Build/Releasing/_Personal-Access-Token.rst:18
msgid "Set **Note** to something like ``Bloom token``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Build/Releasing/_Personal-Access-Token.rst:19
msgid "Set **Expiration** to **No expiration**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Build/Releasing/_Personal-Access-Token.rst:20
msgid "Tick the ``public_repo`` and ``workflow`` checkboxes."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Build/Releasing/_Personal-Access-Token.rst:21
msgid "Click the **Generate token** button."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Build/Releasing/_Personal-Access-Token.rst:23
msgid ""
"After you have created the token, you will end up back at the *Personal "
"access tokens* page. **Copy the alphanumeric token** that is highlighted in "
"green."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Build/Releasing/_Personal-Access-Token.rst:26
msgid ""
"Save your GitHub username and PAT to a new file called ``~/.config/bloom``, "
"with the format below:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Build/Releasing/_Personal-Access-Token.rst:28
msgid ""
"{\n"
"   \"github_user\": \"<your-github-username>\",\n"
"   \"oauth_token\": \"<token-you-created-for-bloom>\"\n"
"}"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Build/Releasing/_Personal-Access-Token.rst:35
msgid ""
"Configure in your ``~/.gitconfig`` that your GitHub account and PAT are used "
"for all release repositories under `ros2-gbp <https://github.com/ros2-gbp>`_:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Build/Releasing/_Personal-Access-Token.rst:37
msgid ""
"[credential \"https://github.com/ros2-gbp\"]\n"
"    username = x-access-token\n"
"    helper = \"!f() { test \\\"$1\\\" = get && echo \\\"password=<token-you-"
"created-for-bloom>\\\"; }; f\""
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Build/Releasing/_Personal-Access-Token.rst:43
msgid ""
"You can additionally use different GitHub accounts and PATs for individual "
"release repositories:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Build/Releasing/_Personal-Access-Token.rst:45
msgid ""
"[credential \"https://github.com/ros2-gbp/my_package-release.git\"]\n"
"    username = x-access-token\n"
"    helper = \"!f() { test \\\"$1\\\" = get && echo \\\"password=<other-"
"token-you-created-for-bloom>\\\"; }; f\""
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Build/Releasing/First-Time-Release.rst:41
msgid "Ensure repositories are up-to-date"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Build/Releasing/_Ensure-Repositories-Are-Up-To-Date.rst:5
msgid "Make sure that:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Developer-Tools/Build/Releasing/_Ensure-Repositories-Are-Up-To-Date.rst:7
